{"seq":4,"slug":"langgraph","title":"LangGraph 状态化工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langgraph","wordCount":1039,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"langgraph-状态化工作流\">LangGraph 状态化工作流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LangGraph 是 LangChain 生态中用于构建有状态、多步骤 AI 应用的框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>以有向图（Directed Graph）为核心抽象</li>\n<li>每个节点是一个计算步骤，边定义了控制流</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"与线性-chain-的本质差异\">与线性 Chain 的本质差异</h3><ul>\n<li>与传统 Chain 的线性执行不同，LangGraph 支持循环、条件分支和并行执行</li>\n<li>能够表达复杂的 Agent 工作流，同时保持可控性和可观测性</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[START]--&gt;B[路由节点]&#10;    B--&gt;|需要搜索|C[搜索节点]&#10;    B--&gt;|需要计算|D[计算节点]&#10;    B--&gt;|直接回答|E[回答节点]&#10;    C--&gt;F{质量检查}&#10;    D--&gt;F&#10;    F--&gt;|通过|E&#10;    F--&gt;|不通过|B&#10;    E--&gt;G[END]\">flowchart TD\n    A[START]--&gt;B[路由节点]\n    B--&gt;|需要搜索|C[搜索节点]\n    B--&gt;|需要计算|D[计算节点]\n    B--&gt;|直接回答|E[回答节点]\n    C--&gt;F{质量检查}\n    D--&gt;F\n    F--&gt;|通过|E\n    F--&gt;|不通过|B\n    E--&gt;G[END]</pre><h3 id=\"lcel-chain-与-langgraph-对比\">LCEL Chain 与 LangGraph 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>LCEL Chain</th>\n<th>LangGraph</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行模型</td>\n<td>有向无环图（DAG）</td>\n<td>有向图（支持循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>无内置状态</td>\n<td>强类型状态对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n<td>内置检查点机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工干预</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>原生中断/恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>完整图可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>简单管道</td>\n<td>复杂多步骤工作流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图的构建与状态设计\">图的构建与状态设计</h2><p>LangGraph 的核心是 <code>StateGraph</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它定义了状态的结构和图的拓扑</li>\n<li>状态通过 TypeScript 类型或 Zod Schema 定义，在节点间自动传递和更新</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"状态定义与-reducer\">状态定义与 reducer</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>reducer 策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>messages</code></td>\n<td><code>BaseMessage[]</code></td>\n<td>追加合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>currentStep</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>searchResults</code></td>\n<td><code>string[]</code></td>\n<td>追加合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const AgentState = Annotation.Root({&#10;  messages: Annotation&lt;BaseMessage[]&gt;({&#10;    reducer: appendReducer,&#10;    default: () =&gt; [],&#10;  }),&#10;  currentStep: Annotation&lt;string&gt;({&#10;    reducer: overwriteReducer,&#10;  }),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AgentState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Annotation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Annotation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reducer: appendReducer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currentStep: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Annotation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reducer: overwriteReducer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"节点即函数\">节点即函数</h3><p>每个节点是一个接收状态、返回状态增量的异步函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const routeNode = async (state) =&gt; {&#10;  const response = await model.invoke([systemPrompt, lastMessage(state)]);&#10;  return { currentStep: response.content };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> routeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([systemPrompt, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lastMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state)]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { currentStep: response.content };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"拓扑组装\">拓扑组装</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>addNode(name, fn)</code></td>\n<td>注册计算节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>addEdge(from, to)</code></td>\n<td>固定控制流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>addConditionalEdges()</code></td>\n<td>按状态动态路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>compile()</code></td>\n<td>生成可调用图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const graph = builder&#10;  .addNode(&#39;route&#39;, routeNode)&#10;  .addNode(&#39;search&#39;, searchNode)&#10;  .addEdge(START, &#39;route&#39;)&#10;  .addConditionalEdges(&#39;route&#39;, router)&#10;  .addEdge(&#39;answer&#39;, END)&#10;  .compile();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, routeNode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, searchNode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEdge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">START</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addConditionalEdges</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, router)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEdge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'answer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"状态设计原则\">状态设计原则</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>最小化状态</strong>——只在状态中保留节点间需要共享的数据</li>\n<li><code>reducer</code> 函数定义了如何合并更新</li>\n<li><code>messages</code> 通常使用追加策略，而标量值使用覆盖策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"检查点与持久化\">检查点与持久化</h2><p>LangGraph 的检查点机制允许在任意节点保存完整的图状态，是构建长时间运行 Agent 的关键能力，支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>暂停/恢复</li>\n<li>时间回溯</li>\n<li>故障恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"启用检查点与多轮会话\">启用检查点与多轮会话</h3><p>同一 <code>thread_id</code> 下的多次调用共享状态，实现跨轮对话记忆：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const graph = builder.compile({&#10;  checkpointer: new MemorySaver(),&#10;});&#10;const config = {&#10;  configurable: { thread_id: &#39;session-123&#39; },&#10;};&#10;await graph.invoke(firstQuestion, config);&#10;await graph.invoke(followUpQuestion, config);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  checkpointer: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemorySaver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  configurable: { thread_id: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'session-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(firstQuestion, config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(followUpQuestion, config);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"时间回溯\">时间回溯</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const history = await persistentGraph.getStateHistory(config);&#10;for await (const snapshot of history) {&#10;  console.log(`步骤: ${snapshot.metadata?.step}, 节点: ${snapshot.next}`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> persistentGraph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getStateHistory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`步骤: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">?.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">step</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, 节点: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"检查点后端选型\">检查点后端选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查点后端</th>\n<th>持久性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MemorySaver</td>\n<td>进程内</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>开发调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SqliteSaver</td>\n<td>文件级</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>单机部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgresSaver</td>\n<td>远程数据库</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 Saver</td>\n<td>按实现</td>\n<td>按实现</td>\n<td>特殊需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"人工介入与中断\">人工介入与中断</h2><p>LangGraph 原生支持人工介入（Human-in-the-Loop）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>允许在指定节点暂停执行，等待人工审批或修改后继续</li>\n<li>对于高风险操作（如支付、数据删除）至关重要</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"配置中断点\">配置中断点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>interruptBefore</code></td>\n<td>进入指定节点前暂停</td>\n<td>高危操作执行前审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>interruptAfter</code></td>\n<td>指定节点完成后暂停</td>\n<td>检查中间产物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const graphWithInterrupt = graphBuilder.compile({&#10;  checkpointer: new MemorySaver(),&#10;  interruptBefore: [&#39;execute&#39;],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> graphWithInterrupt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graphBuilder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  checkpointer: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemorySaver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  interruptBefore: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'execute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"审批-恢复流程\">审批-恢复流程</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>调用</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><code>invoke(input, config)</code></td>\n<td>执行到中断点前自动暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code>getState(config)</code></td>\n<td>查看当前状态与下一步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><code>updateState(config, ...)</code></td>\n<td>注入人工审批结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>invoke(null, config)</code></td>\n<td>从检查点恢复继续执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"与检查点的协同\">与检查点的协同</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时刻</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中断时</td>\n<td>自动保存状态到检查点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复时</td>\n<td>从检查点加载，进程重启后也能继续执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"子图与模块化\">子图与模块化</h2><ul>\n<li>复杂的 Agent 系统通常由多个子图组成</li>\n<li>LangGraph 支持将子图作为节点嵌入到父图中，实现关注点分离和复用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"子图嵌入示例\">子图嵌入示例</h3><ul>\n<li>研究子图（search → summarize）先独立 <code>compile()</code></li>\n<li>再作为普通节点挂进父图：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const parentGraph = builder&#10;  .addNode(&#39;route&#39;, routeNode)&#10;  .addNode(&#39;research&#39;, subgraph)&#10;  .addEdge(START, &#39;route&#39;)&#10;  .addEdge(&#39;answer&#39;, END)&#10;  .compile();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parentGraph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, routeNode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'research'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, subgraph)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEdge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">START</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEdge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'answer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"子图设计原则\">子图设计原则</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[父图]--&gt;R[研究子图]&#10;    P--&gt;W[写作子图]&#10;    P--&gt;C[审核子图]&#10;    R--&gt;S[共享状态接口]&#10;    W--&gt;S&#10;    C--&gt;S\">flowchart TD\n    P[父图]--&gt;R[研究子图]\n    P--&gt;W[写作子图]\n    P--&gt;C[审核子图]\n    R--&gt;S[共享状态接口]\n    W--&gt;S\n    C--&gt;S</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一职责</td>\n<td>每个子图完成一个独立功能单元（研究/写作/审核）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态接口</td>\n<td>通过统一的状态接口与父图通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LangGraph 以有向图为核心抽象，支持循环、条件分支和并行，适合复杂的多步骤 Agent 工作流</li>\n<li>状态设计遵循最小化原则，reducer 函数定义更新策略，消息追加、标量覆盖</li>\n<li>检查点机制实现了持久化状态，支持暂停/恢复、时间回溯和故障恢复</li>\n<li>人工介入通过 <code>interruptBefore</code>/<code>interruptAfter</code> 实现，与检查点协同保证流程可靠性</li>\n<li>子图模式实现了关注点分离，每个子图完成独立功能单元，通过状态接口通信</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LangGraph 状态化工作流","id":"langgraph-状态化工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"与线性 Chain 的本质差异","id":"与线性-chain-的本质差异"},{"level":3,"text":"LCEL Chain 与 LangGraph 对比","id":"lcel-chain-与-langgraph-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"图的构建与状态设计","id":"图的构建与状态设计"},{"level":3,"text":"状态定义与 reducer","id":"状态定义与-reducer"},{"level":3,"text":"节点即函数","id":"节点即函数"},{"level":3,"text":"拓扑组装","id":"拓扑组装"},{"level":3,"text":"状态设计原则","id":"状态设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"检查点与持久化","id":"检查点与持久化"},{"level":3,"text":"启用检查点与多轮会话","id":"启用检查点与多轮会话"},{"level":3,"text":"时间回溯","id":"时间回溯"},{"level":3,"text":"检查点后端选型","id":"检查点后端选型"},{"level":2,"text":"人工介入与中断","id":"人工介入与中断"},{"level":3,"text":"配置中断点","id":"配置中断点"},{"level":3,"text":"审批-恢复流程","id":"审批-恢复流程"},{"level":3,"text":"与检查点的协同","id":"与检查点的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"子图与模块化","id":"子图与模块化"},{"level":3,"text":"子图嵌入示例","id":"子图嵌入示例"},{"level":3,"text":"子图设计原则","id":"子图设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LangChain 工具系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langchain-tools"},"next":{"title":"CrewAI 多代理协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/crewai"}}